      "created_at": "2015-01-12T04:04:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And a 0 hp construct (It works if you have Fixed Point in play!) is worth 1 damage, and a -1 hp construct is worth 0 damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Fixed point with a Dynamic Syhpon in play on AZ with Thermal Shockwave + Coolant Blast is amazing, we beat that Syphon down to something like -20 hp. &nbsp;Az was in some pretty harsh negatives as well, but Dawn and her citizens all went down with him. &nbsp;The last coolant blast was worth something like 45 damage.</p>",
