      "id": 126890,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-12T04:20:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And a 0 hp construct (It works if you have Fixed Point in play!) is worth 1 damage, and a -1 hp construct is worth 0 damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Captain Cosmic would be unable to deal damage with Potent Disruption with Fixed Point in play, as it deals damage equal to the destroyed contruct's HP. It wouldn't be destroyed if Fixed Point is there.</p>",
