      "raw": "[quote=\"jsz2\"]\n\nAnd a 0 hp construct (It works if you have Fixed Point in play!) is worth 1 damage, and a -1 hp construct is worth 0 damage.\n\n[/quote]\n\nCaptain Cosmic would be unable to deal damage with Potent Disruption with Fixed Point in play, as it deals damage equal to the <u>destroyed</u> contruct&#39;s HP. It wouldn&#39;t be destroyed if Fixed Point is there.\n",
